wire n00l00.k n00l01.k
wire n00l00.a n00l02.a
wire n00l00.k n00l02.k
wire n00l00.a n00l03.a
wire n00l00.k n00l03.k
wire n00l00.a n00l04.a
wire n00l00.k n00l04.k
wire n00l04.result n00l05.A
wire n00l03.result n00l05.B
wire n00l02.result n00l05.G
